<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Verde Salon &amp; Spa</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--sage:#6E8B6A;--sage-d:#4F6B4C;--blush:#E7CFC7;--cream:#F7F4EE;--ink:#2E332B;--muted:#7A8177;}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--cream);font-weight:300}
.head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:26px 60px;background:transparent}
.logo{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--sage-d)}
.logo span{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:6px;display:block;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-family:'Jost';text-transform:uppercase}
.nav{display:flex;gap:32px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#555b52;text-transform:uppercase}
.book{border:1px solid var(--sage);color:var(--sage-d);padding:11px 22px;border-radius:40px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;min-height:560px}
.hero .txt{padding:80px 60px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:24px}
.hero h1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-weight:500;font-size:76px;line-height:1.02;color:var(--ink)}
.hero h1 i{color:var(--sage-d)}
.hero p{margin-top:26px;max-width:420px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}
.cta{margin-top:38px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
.btn{background:var(--sage-d);color:#fff;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:40px;border:none;font-family:'Jost';font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase}
.link{color:var(--sage-d);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--blush);padding-bottom:3px}
.hero .art{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--blush) 0%,#cbb7 b0 40%,var(--sage) 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero .art{background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1781450090585-1a511b7066d9?w=1300&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat}
.hero .art::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 55%,rgba(79,107,76,.22))}
.strip{background:#fff;padding:64px 60px;text-align:center}
.strip .e{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:12px}
.strip h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:40px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:44px}
.svcs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto}
.svc h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:26px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
.svc .price{color:var(--sage-d);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:10px}
.svc p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}
.svc .rule{width:40px;height:1px;background:var(--blush);margin:0 auto 20px}
.quote{background:var(--sage-d);color:#F1EDE4;padding:70px 60px;text-align:center;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-style:italic;font-size:32px;line-height:1.4}
.quote small{display:block;font-style:normal;font-family:'Jost';font-size:13px;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:22px;color:var(--blush)}
.foot{background:var(--cream);padding:36px 60px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .head{padding:18px 22px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
 .nav{display:none}
 .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:0}
 .hero .txt{padding:44px 22px}
 .hero h1{font-size:46px}
 .hero .art{min-height:300px}
 .strip{padding:44px 22px}
 .svcs{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
 .quote{padding:46px 22px;font-size:24px}
 .foot{flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
}
</style></head>
<body>
<header class="head">
  <div class="logo">Verde<span>salon &amp; spa</span></div>
  <nav class="nav"><span>Hair</span><span>Skin</span><span>Team</span><span>Gallery</span></nav>
  <a class="book">Book an Appointment</a>
</header>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="txt">
    <div class="eyebrow">Boutique salon · South Tampa</div>
    <h1>Quiet luxury<br>for your <i>hair</i><br>and skin.</h1>
    <p>A calm, low-tox studio for cut, color, and skincare — unhurried appointments and results that grow out beautifully.</p>
    <div class="cta"><button class="btn">Book an Appointment</button><a class="link">View Services</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="art"></div>
</section>
<section class="strip">
  <div class="e">The Menu</div>
  <h2>Considered, never rushed.</h2>
  <div class="svcs">
    <div class="svc"><div class="rule"></div><h3>Cut &amp; Style</h3><div class="price">from $75</div><p>Precision cutting with a blow-dry finish tailored to your texture.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><div class="rule"></div><h3>Dimensional Color</h3><div class="price">from $140</div><p>Balayage, gloss, and lived-in color using ammonia-free lines.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><div class="rule"></div><h3>Signature Facial</h3><div class="price">from $110</div><p>A restorative treatment ritual with a scalp and shoulder massage.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="quote">“It’s the only place I leave feeling like the best version of myself.”<small>— Maren S., client since 2021</small></section>
<footer class="foot"><span>Verde Salon &amp; Spa · Tampa, FL</span><span>@verde.salon · (813) 555-0199</span></footer>
</body></html>
